Five candidates are vying to lead France's social-democratic left in the 2027 presidential election, with a cyberattack disrupting the primary vote. Can the left unite behind one candidate? We discuss this with our guest Joseph Downing, Senior Lecturer in Politics and International Relations at Aston University.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/81d3fff6-c578-11f1-9043-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-140327-141217-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/81d3fff6-c578-11f1-9043-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-140327-141217-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">869fe1e4-c578-11f1-89da-9dfb10f1d5b9</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:41:39 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><title>🔴 Trump says Russia and Ukraine agree to 'energy ceasefire'</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261011-trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-agree-energy-ceasefire</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">bb27029a-c581-11f1-b005-1369c0b136c4</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:41:09 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>India's 'cockroach' leaders vow to keep up election protests</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-india-s-cockroach-leaders-vow-to-keep-up-election-protests</link><description>
Leaders of India's online "cockroach" movement pledged on Sunday to continue their campaign against the election commissioner, hours after they were released from detention as authorities sought to thwart a major demonstration. Our correspondent Navodita Kumari tells us more.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f57e0a1c-c575-11f1-b681-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-131551-131920-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f57e0a1c-c575-11f1-b681-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-131551-131920-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">fa1020f6-c575-11f1-b8cd-697ffb592b67</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:40:27 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Strike on Riyadh: What options for the Saudi-led coalition?</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-strike-on-riyadh-what-options-for-the-saudi-led-coalition</link><description>
Saturday's attack, the deadliest on Saudi soil in more than a decade, marked a sharp escalation in the Yemen war. Riyadh backs the internationally recognised government against the Houthis, who captured swathes of the Red Sea coastline in a lightning offensive last month.

The Saudi-led coalition has vowed a firm response, but what options are on the table? We discuss this with Dr Nawaf Obaid, Senior Research Fellow in the Department of War Studies at King's College London.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/e10ae9f8-c573-11f1-b6f9-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-130408-131443-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/e10ae9f8-c573-11f1-b6f9-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-130408-131443-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">e62c3996-c573-11f1-972a-a13ad11b9acb</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:39:27 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>Trump says Russia and Ukraine agree to 'energy ceasefire'</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-agree-energy-ceasefire</link><description>
US President Trump said Sunday via social media platform Truth Social that Russia and Ukraine had agreed to an energy ceasefire. Neither Kyiv nor Moscow have confirmed their agreement. 
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/0873ab7c-c580-11f1-b3d3-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26284044155459.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/0873ab7c-c580-11f1-b3d3-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26284044155459.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">3a4cc5de-c580-11f1-b389-2392262d07b9</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:39:26 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/0873ab7c-c580-11f1-b3d3-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26284044155459.jpg">© Nathan Howard, AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Strike on Riyadh: Trump signals US could join action against Houthis</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-strike-on-riyadh-trump-signals-us-could-join-action-against-houthis</link><description>
The assault on Riyadh's airport drew condemnation from the United Nations and world leaders including US President Donald Trump, who said he was considering joining Saudi strikes against the Houthis.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/c2177c9c-c572-11f1-8c32-e362370cce2e/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-130204-130405-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/c2177c9c-c572-11f1-8c32-e362370cce2e/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-130204-130405-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c7648b0e-c572-11f1-8f93-a38e968cfab4</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:34:54 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>The week in pictures: French student protests, October 7 anniversary and Adenot's return to Earth</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-the-week-in-pictures-french-student-protests-october-7-anniversary-and-adenot-return-to-earth</link><description>
Blockades and protests by French secondary school and university students continued, occasionally becoming violent; French astronaut Sophie Adenot returned to Earth after eight months aboard the International Space Station; Israel's commemorations marking the three-year anniversary of the October 7 attacks: here's a look back at some of the most striking images from the past week's news.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/eed9187a-c3ed-11f1-9c6b-3774aeac812a/w:1024/p:16x9/000-D2EA23A.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/eed9187a-c3ed-11f1-9c6b-3774aeac812a/w:1024/p:16x9/000-D2EA23A.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">8c992ebe-c4a8-11f1-8bd6-b5bb5635234c</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:17:55 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/eed9187a-c3ed-11f1-9c6b-3774aeac812a/w:1024/p:16x9/000-D2EA23A.jpg">© Kenzo Tribouillard, AFP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>Brazil's Lula accuses social media giant Meta of election interference amid tight run-off campaign</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261011-brazil-lula-accuses-social-media-giant-meta-election-interference-amid-tight-run-campaign</link><description>
Social media platform Meta has 48 hours to respond to claims by Brazil's leftwing candidate and incumbent President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva's campaign accusing the tech platform of blocking content on the company's platforms. Brazil's Superior Electoral Court on Saturday gave the social media giant 48 hours to clarify whether it reduced the reach of posts by Lula's campaign ahead of the tight October 25 run-off against rightwing candidate Flavio Bolsonaro. 
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3c380a90-c56f-11f1-a8f8-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/000-36TD3C3.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3c380a90-c56f-11f1-a8f8-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/000-36TD3C3.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">eda9e804-c56d-11f1-8ad3-0dfce67db219</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:12:09 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3c380a90-c56f-11f1-a8f8-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/000-36TD3C3.jpg">© Kirill Kudryavtsev, AFP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><title>🔴Pope Leo says will undergo surgery for early-stage lung nodule</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-pope-leo-says-will-undergo-surgery-for-early-stage-lung-nodule</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">6fc935ec-c55f-11f1-b2d6-07a94e8c67f0</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:35:34 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>Pope Leo says will undergo surgery for early-stage lung nodule</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-pope-leo-says-will-undergo-surgery-for-early-stage-lung-nodule</link><description>
Pope Leo XIV said Sunday he would undergo surgery in the coming days for a lung nodule detected at an early stage.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/acda1916-c55e-11f1-9f1f-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26284369740018-1.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/acda1916-c55e-11f1-9f1f-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26284369740018-1.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">5840b1ee-c55e-11f1-81c6-932e761b873a</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:34:22 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/acda1916-c55e-11f1-9f1f-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26284369740018-1.jpg">© Gregorio Borgia, AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Trump says Ukraine needs new president who will agree to end war</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-trump-says-ukraine-needs-new-president-who-will-agree-to-end-war</link><description>
US President Donald Trump on Saturday urged Ukraine to replace Volodymyr Zelensky with a new leader, criticising him over strikes on Russian oil refineries that have contributed to high diesel prices ahead of the US midterm elections.

Trump told reporters at the White House that he had told Zelensky to "do what you want" against Russia, but "don't hit refineries".

"He better damn well stop," Trump said, adding that he believes "it's time for Ukraine to get a new president" who would agree to end the war.

We discuss the latest developments with our guest, Pyotr Kurzin, host of The Global Gambit.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/6dd43968-c55e-11f1-828e-3774aeac812a/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-18084351466acb64ae3fdab8-31038353.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/6dd43968-c55e-11f1-828e-3774aeac812a/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-18084351466acb64ae3fdab8-31038353.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">8bc75a5c-c55b-11f1-b0a0-b5ce847f6625</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:28:56 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Spain: Sánchez and Feijóo launch campaigns</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-spain-s%C3%A1nchez-and-feij%C3%B3o-launch-campaigns</link><description>
Although Spain's general election is set to take place on November 29, the battle has already begun.

Over the weekend, Prime Minister Pedro Sánchez and his main conservative challenger, Alberto Núñez Feijóo, kicked off their pre-election rallies, targeting each other's key vulnerabilities.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/64c02080-c559-11f1-ae7a-77317c09f325/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-110923-111114-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/64c02080-c559-11f1-ae7a-77317c09f325/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-110923-111114-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">69ccc56a-c559-11f1-a91d-b1df413b0520</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:23:38 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>Ukraine says ready to halt refinery strikes if Moscow stops energy attacks</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261011-ukraine-ready-halt-refinery-strikes-if-moscow-stops-energy-attacks-zelensky-says</link><description>
Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky on Sunday said Kyiv was ready to halt strikes Russian oil refineries if Moscow stopped attacks on Ukrainian energy infrastructure. Zelensky also pushed back on US President Donald Trump's comments made Saturday evening calling for Ukraine to elect a new leader by saying, "It's up to our people".
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f1f72c30-c55b-11f1-941b-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-10-09T204400Z-1727445418-RC2WZNAE754C-RTRMADP-3-RUSSIA-USA-DIESEL-UKRAINE-ZELENSKIY.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f1f72c30-c55b-11f1-941b-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-10-09T204400Z-1727445418-RC2WZNAE754C-RTRMADP-3-RUSSIA-USA-DIESEL-UKRAINE-ZELENSKIY.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">69b1340a-c55c-11f1-beae-4f611ffe173f</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:21:07 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f1f72c30-c55b-11f1-941b-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-10-09T204400Z-1727445418-RC2WZNAE754C-RTRMADP-3-RUSSIA-USA-DIESEL-UKRAINE-ZELENSKIY.jpg">© Valentyn Ogirenko, Reuters</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Trump, Zelensky clash over diesel deal as Russian strikes kill 21</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-trump-zelensky-clash-over-diesel-deal-as-russian-strikes-kill-21</link><description>
US President Donald Trump and Ukrainian leader Volodymyr Zelensky traded barbs Saturday after Washington moved to ease sanctions on Russian diesel and Moscow's continued strikes on Ukraine killed at least 21 people, including four children.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/14ffaa84-c559-11f1-b8e4-e362370cce2e/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-110713-110852-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/14ffaa84-c559-11f1-b8e4-e362370cce2e/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-110713-110852-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">19deff96-c559-11f1-8268-5de6713b4495</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:10:20 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><title>🔴At least 109 migrants dead, more than 100 missing after boat capsizes off Djibouti</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/africa/20261011-at-least-hundred-migrants-dead-scores-missing-after-boat-capsizes-off-djibouti</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">15dbd884-c558-11f1-873d-7bcac83ac67b</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:43:01 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Africa</category><title>At least 139 migrants dead, more than 84 missing after boat capsizes off Djibouti</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/africa/20261011-at-least-hundred-migrants-dead-scores-missing-after-boat-capsizes-off-djibouti</link><description>
At least 139 migrants, including at least 15 children, died and 84 remain missing after a boat carrying 350 people capsized off Djibouti en route to Yemen, the International Organisation for Migration said on Sunday.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/b04f8942-c57b-11f1-9bf6-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/000-D2WH3JN.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/b04f8942-c57b-11f1-9bf6-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/000-D2WH3JN.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c0963284-c552-11f1-be29-d3f466d13013</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:24:40 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/b04f8942-c57b-11f1-9bf6-53993c5f1f18/w:1024/p:16x9/000-D2WH3JN.jpg">© Organisation internationale pour les migrations (OIM) de Djibouti via AFP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>'Going bankrupt': Iran shopkeepers struggle as war dims demand</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-going-bankrupt-iran-shopkeepers-struggle-as-war-dims-demand</link><description>
Iran's economy has been battered by years of sanctions, but the conflict that began in February with US-Israeli attacks and an American blockade of the country's ports has put extra strain on daily life.
 
Rising inflation, nearly 90 percent year-on-year in September according to official figures, and erratic currency exchange fluctuations have driven up the cost of everyday items. Food prices have more than doubled since last year.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/4d7c0954-c54d-11f1-b6d8-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-100629-100815-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/4d7c0954-c54d-11f1-b6d8-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-100629-100815-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">52244246-c54d-11f1-a764-f1ea7c86cf6d</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:22:37 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Trump urges Zelensky replacement as diesel row rages</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-trump-urges-zelensky-replacement-as-diesel-row-rages</link><description>
Donald Trump called on Saturday for Ukraine to "get a new leader" after Volodymyr Zelensky slammed Washington's easing of Russian diesel sanctions, as the US president faces fuel price pressure weeks before midterm elections. Our correspondent Gulliver Cragg tells us more.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/b79a3270-c54d-11f1-bde5-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-080749-081231-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/b79a3270-c54d-11f1-bde5-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-080749-081231-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">bc65d61a-c54d-11f1-b4e6-1bbeb98c366a</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:21:59 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>At least 4 dead as cyclone Isaias drenches southern US</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261011-at-least-4-dead-as-cyclone-isaias-drenches-southern-us</link><description>
Four people died in the southeastern United States as post-tropical cyclone Isaias threatened flooding and tornado risks Saturday as it moved northward after making landfall on Florida's Gulf Coast.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/6dc2533e-c54e-11f1-982a-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-101112-101314-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/6dc2533e-c54e-11f1-982a-29a2e29ae696/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261011-101112-101314-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">72d861a6-c54e-11f1-8916-032be0d6b0d6</guid><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:18:48 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Sports</category><title>France's Seixas claims Il Lombardia glory after world championship heartbreak</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/sports/20261011-france-s-seixas-claims-il-lombardia-glory-after-world-championship-heartbreak</link><description>
Disappointed with his performance at the World Championships two weeks ago, French cyclist Paul Seixas quickly made up for it at the final Monument of the season. He won the Tour of Lombardy, setting a new record as the race’s youngest-ever winner in the process.
